body: `
<h2>Coding-Decoding Ka Aadhaar</h2><p>Angrezi varnamala me har akshar ki ek sthiti hoti hai. A barabar 1 se Z barabar 26 tak. Coding ke prashn isi sthiti par khelte hain. Sabse pehle ye paanch niyam yaad rakho: sthiti ka yog, sthiti ka ulta, aage-peeche shift, aksharon ka ulta kram, aur sthiti ko jodkar sankhya banana. Jo niyam diye gaye shabd par lagu hota hai, wahi niyam poochhe gaye shabd par lagao.</p><h2>Niyam 1: Opposite Letters</h2><p>Opposite akshar ka yog hamesha 27 hota hai. A ka opposite Z, B ka opposite Y, C ka opposite X, M ka opposite N hai. Udaaharan ke liye MANGO ka opposite code NZMTL banta hai, kyunki M ka opposite N, A ka opposite Z, N ka opposite M, G ka opposite T, O ka opposite L hai. Aise hi GRAPE ka opposite code TIZKV banta hai. Opposite pehchanne ki tez trick ye hai ki akshar ke saath 27 se ghatao, jo bache wahi opposite ki sthiti hai.</p><h2>Niyam 2: Plus-Minus Shift</h2><p>Kai baar har akshar ko ek nishchit sankhya se aage ya peeche khiskaya jaata hai. DELHI ka code EFMIJ hai kyunki har akshar 1 aage badha hai. MUMBAI ka code NVNCBJ banega. Kathin prashn me shift badalta hai, jaise pehla akshar plus 2, doosra minus 2, teesra plus 2. GOOD ka code IMQB banta hai kyunki G plus 2 barabar I, O minus 2 barabar M, O plus 2 barabar Q, D minus 2 barabar B hai. Shift ka pattern akshar-dar-akshar jaancho.</p><h2>Niyam 3: Position Ka Yog Aur Jod</h2><p>Kai codes me aksharon ki sthitiyon ka yog hi code hota hai. CAT ka yog 3 plus 1 plus 20 barabar 24 hai, DOG ka yog 4 plus 15 plus 7 barabar 26 hai, isliye BAT ka yog 2 plus 1 plus 20 barabar 23 hoga. Doosri vidhi me sthitiyon ko seedha jodkar likha jaata hai. CAT ki sthitiyan 3, 1, 20 ko jodne par 3120 banta hai, DOG ki sthitiyan 4, 15, 7 ko jodne par 4157 banta hai, isliye RAT ki sthitiyan 18, 1, 20 ko jodne par 18120 banega. Dono me farq saaf samjho, ek me yog hota hai, doosre me sthitiyon ka kram.</p><h2>Niyam 4: Ulta Kram Aur Ulti Sthiti</h2><p>Ulte kram me shabd ko ulta likha jaata hai. INDIA ka ulta AIDNI hai, BHARAT ka ulta TARAHB hai. Ulti sthiti me A ko 26, B ko 25 mana jaata hai. Is niyam me CAT ka code 24267 banta hai kyunki C ki ulti sthiti 24, A ki 26, T ki 7 hai. Ulta kram aur ulti sthiti alag niyam hain, inhe milao mat.</p><h2>Common Traps</h2><ul><li>Opposite aur shift ko ek saath mat milao, pehle diye gaye shabd par niyam poori tarah pariksha karo.</li><li>Plus 1 ka code dekhkar har baar wahi mat mano, ho sakta hai shift badal raha ho.</li><li>Yog wale code me do ankon wali sthitiyon ko jodne ki galti mat karo.</li><li>Code likhte waqt aksharon ka kram na badle, jab tak ulta kram ka sanket na ho.</li></ul><h2>Solved Example</h2><p>Yadi APPLE ka code ZKKOV hai to ORANGE ka code kya hoga. Yahan opposite ka niyam hai. O ka opposite L, R ka opposite I, A ka opposite Z, N ka opposite M, G ka opposite T, E ka opposite V hai. Isliye ORANGE ka code LIZMTV hoga. Har akshar par niyam jaanchna zaroori hai, ek akshar se faisla mat lo.</p><blockquote>Speed tip: pehle opposite jaancho, phir shift, phir yog. Teen jaanch me niyam mil jaata hai. Varnamala ki sthitiyan aur opposite jode muh-zabani yaad rakho.</blockquote>
`
