excerpt: "Blood relations ke advanced prashn — family tree, pointing questions aur coded relations ko bina uljhe hal karne ki poori vidhi.",
body: `
<h2>Blood Relations Me Sabse Badi Galti</h2><p>Zyadatar galtiyan isliye hoti hain kyunki hum sambandh muh-zabani jodne lagte hain. Sahi tareeka ye hai ki peedhi-dar-peedhi chitra banao. Sabse upar dada-dadi, beech me mata-pita, neeche bachche. Purush ke liye alag nishan aur mahila ke liye alag nishan man me rakho. Vivaah ka sambandh ek rekha se jodo. Jab chitra ban jaata hai to prashn khud sulajh jaata hai.</p><h2>Peedhi Ka Niyam</h2><p>Mata-pita se ek peedhi upar dada-dadi aur nana-nani hote hain, do peedhi upar par-dada aur par-nani hote hain. Apni peedhi me bhai-behen aur chachere-mamere bhai-behen aate hain. Ek peedhi neeche beta-beti aur bhanja-bhanji aate hain. Do peedhi neeche pota-poti aur nata-natin aate hain. Peedhi ginna seekh lo to bada-nana, par-dadi jaise shabdon me bhram nahi hoga. Udaaharan ke liye dadi ka bhai par-nana ke barabar ka rishta nahi, balki great-uncle kehlata hai.</p><h2>Pointing Questions Ki Kala</h2><p>Pointing wale prashn me vakta khud kendra hota hai. Meri maa ki ekmatra beti ka arth meri behen hai, jab vakta purush hai. Meri nani ki ekmatra beti ka arth meri maa hai. Mere pita ke ekmatra putra ka arth main khud hoon. Isliye prashn ko vakta se shuru karke bahar ki taraf suljhao. Udaaharan ke liye Rohan ne ek ladki ki taraf ishara karke kaha ki vah meri maa ki ekmatra beti ki beti hai. Maa ki ekmatra beti Rohan ki behen hui, uski beti Rohan ki bhanji hui. Answer bhanji hai.</p><h2>Coded Relations</h2><p>Coded prashn me prateekon ka arth pehle likh lo. Maan lo P plus Q ka arth P, Q ka pita hai, P minus Q ka arth P, Q ki mata hai, P guna Q ka arth P, Q ka bhai hai, P bhaag Q ka arth P, Q ki behen hai. Ab vyakt kram se hal karo. Udaaharan ke liye A plus B guna C minus D me A, B ka pita hai, B, C ka bhai hai, C, D ki mata hai. Isliye A, C ka pita hua aur D ka nana hua. Coded prashn me kram ulta mat karo, baen se daen chalo.</p><h2>Saas-Sasur Aur Sali-Jija Jaise Rishte</h2><p>Patni ka bhai sala, patni ki behen sali, pati ka bhai devar ya jeth, pati ki behen nanad kehlati hai. Bhai ki patni bhabhi, behen ka pati jija, bhanje ki patni bhi rishtedari me aati hai. In shabdon ko seedha yaad rakho, angrezi ke brother-in-law jaise shabdon se bhram hota hai kyunki ek angrezi shabd kai hindi rishton ko dhakta hai. Pariksha me hindi rishta hi maanga jaata hai, isliye hindi naam par dhyan do.</p><h2>Common Traps</h2><ul><li>Ekmatra shabd ko halka mat lo, wahi poora prashn badal deta hai.</li><li>Mata ki beti ka arth hamesha behen nahi hota, vakta mahila ho to vah khud bhi ho sakti hai, isliye vakta ka ling dekho.</li><li>Coded prashn me prateek ka arth prashn ke hisaab se badal sakta hai, har baar naya arth likho.</li><li>Dada aur nana ka farq mat bhoolo, ek pita ki taraf hai, doosra mata ki taraf.</li></ul><h2>Solved Example</h2><p>A, B ka bhai hai. B, C ki maa hai. C, D ka pita hai. D, E ka bhai hai. A ka E se kya sambandh hai. B, C ki maa hui, C, D aur E ka pita hua, isliye B, E ki dadi hui. A, B ka bhai hua, isliye A, E ki dadi ka bhai hua, arthaat great-uncle hua. Family tree banane par ye sambandh turant saaf dikhta hai.</p><blockquote>Speed tip: pehle vakta ko kendra mankar chitra banao, phir sambandh ka naam do. Seedha naam dhoondhne ki jaldi me galti hoti hai.</blockquote>
`
