body: `
<h2>Quiz: Blood Relations</h2><div class="quiz-q"><p>Prashn 1: A, B ka pita hai. B, C ki behen hai. C, D ki mata hai. A, D ka kaun hai</p><p>Vikalp: (a) Dada (b) Nana (c) Chacha (d) Mama</p><p>Answer: (b) Nana. Hal: A, B aur C ka pita hua, C, D ki mata hui, isliye A, D ki mata ka pita hua, arthaat nana hua.</p></div><div class="quiz-q"><p>Prashn 2: Ek ladke ki taraf ishara karke ek vyakti ne kaha ki vah mere dada ki ekmatra bahu ka beta hai. Ladka vakta ka kaun hai</p><p>Vikalp: (a) Bhai (b) Beta (c) Bhanja (d) Pota</p><p>Answer: (a) Bhai. Hal: Dada ki ekmatra bahu vakta ki maa hui, uska beta vakta ka bhai hua.</p></div><div class="quiz-q"><p>Prashn 3: M, N ka bhai hai. N, O ki mata hai. O, P ki behen hai. M, P ka kaun hai</p><p>Vikalp: (a) Pita (b) Mama (c) Chacha (d) Dada</p><p>Answer: (b) Mama. Hal: N, O aur P ki mata hui, M, N ka bhai hua, isliye M, P ki mata ka bhai hua, arthaat mama hua.</p></div><div class="quiz-q"><p>Prashn 4: Ek mahila ki taraf ishara karke Amit ne kaha ki vah meri patni ki maa ki ekmatra beti hai. Mahila Amit ki kaun hai</p><p>Vikalp: (a) Saas (b) Patni (c) Sali (d) Behen</p><p>Answer: (b) Patni. Hal: Patni ki maa ki ekmatra beti patni khud hui, isliye mahila Amit ki patni hui.</p></div><div class="quiz-q"><p>Prashn 5: A, B ki patni hai. B, C ka bhai hai. C, D ki maa hai. A, D ki kaun hai</p><p>Vikalp: (a) Maa (b) Chachi (c) Bhabhi (d) Dadi</p><p>Answer: (b) Chachi. Hal: B, D ka mama ya chacha hua kyunki B, D ki maa C ka bhai hai. A, B ki patni hui, isliye A, D ki chachi ya mami hui, yahan vikalp ke hisaab se chachi hui.</p></div>
`
